        "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/ac1ad4b03fb28f5f88a93718c64485b4.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prologue is a free intro to “Burger Shift: Team Rush” 🍔</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or team up with up to 8 players in co-op. Host your own session or join others through the in-game lobby, using built-in voice and text chat to stay connected as you take on the rush. <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run every part of a bustling fast food kitchen, from operating fryers and soda fountains to flipping burgers on the grill. Learn the ins and outs of each station to keep things running smoothly.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected: chaotic events, strange customers, and surprise challenges demand quick thinking and solid teamwork. Communication and coordination are your tools for success. <br>    <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s Included in the Prologue?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order up! Here’s what’s on the menu in the Prologue:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and 1–8 player co-op</strong> – Run the kitchen solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A  selection of signature ingredients and recipes</strong> – Including baked goods, frying, and burger prep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soda fountain and coffee machine</strong> – Serve cold sodas and hot coffee to keep your customers satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> – Pick your gear and show off your <i>style</i> with early outfit and character options.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prologue is a free intro to “Burger Shift: Team Rush” 🍔</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in solo or team up with up to 8 players in co-op. Host your own session or join others through the in-game lobby, using built-in voice and text chat to stay connected as you take on the rush. <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run every part of a bustling fast food kitchen, from operating fryers and soda fountains to flipping burgers on the grill. Learn the ins and outs of each station to keep things running smoothly.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected: chaotic events, strange customers, and surprise challenges demand quick thinking and solid teamwork. Communication and coordination are your tools for success. <br>    <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1789124839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821150/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1789124839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s Included in the Prologue?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order up! Here’s what’s on the menu in the Prologue:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and 1–8 player co-op</strong> – Run the kitchen solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A  selection of signature ingredients and recipes</strong> – Including baked goods, frying, and burger prep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soda fountain and coffee machine</strong> – Serve cold sodas and hot coffee to keep your customers satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> – Pick your gear and show off your <i>style</i> with early outfit and character options.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Run the world's most chaotic fast food joint! Play solo or with up to 8 friends as you take orders, make burgers, and hustle to keep customers happy. Grow your business with every shift.",
